  <h1>Battery maintenance</h1>
  <p>This original synthetic article is an offline extraction fixture, not advice about a real product.</p>
  <h2>Storage temperature</h2>
  <p>The reference storage temperature is 18 degrees Celsius. Keep the sample device dry and inspect its case before use.</p>
  <h2>Charge schedule</h2>
  <p>The reference inspection interval is every 30 days. Record the charge level and any change in the sample device.</p>
  <p>Read the <a href="../manual?edition=2&amp;language=en#storage">versioned manual</a> for the synthetic procedure.</p>
